msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"<p><b>Note:</b> this is the same thing as the \"incremental\" option in the Krita 1.6 freehand tool options.</p>"
"</html>"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"<p><b>Beacht:</b> Dit is dat Sülvige as de Optschoon \"Towass\" in't Freehand-Warktüüch vun Krita 1.6.</p>"
"</html>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, label)
#. +> trunk
#: plugins/paintops/libpaintop/wdgincremental.ui:50
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"<p><b>Painting mode</b>: Krita offers a choice between two painting modes: <i>buildup</i> and <i>wash</i>. The first choice builds up color while painting in one stroke, the second choices gives you an even color in one stroke even if you go over the same place again and again.</p>"
"</html>"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"<p><b>Maalbedrief</b>: Krita stellt twee Oorden vun Maalbedrieven praat: <i>Towassmalen</i> un <i>Spölen</i>. De eerste Optschoon buut bi't Teken mit elkeen Streek mehr Farv op, de twete Optschoon gifft jümmers de sülve Klöör, ok wenn Een mehrmalig över de sülve Steed maalt.</p>"
"</html>"

