#~ "<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-weight:600;\">Painting mode</span>: Krita offers a choice between two painting modes: <span style=\" font-style:italic;\">buildup</span> and <span style=\" font-style:italic;\">wash</span>. The first choice builds up color while painting in one stroke, the second choices gives you an even color in one stroke even if you go over the same place again and again.</p>"
